<p>For tinyEmail, Sequenzy email depth beside Postscript SMS separates welcome campaign moments from list fatigue. Patchwork Denim (upcycled fashion, $54k/mo) runs one-of-one pieces — sms for new listing drops only to style-preference segments. Operating lesson: Generic blasts had 0.3% conversion vs 4.1% for tailored drops. Postscript ranks #1 for SMS campaign execution on shopifysmsmarketingapps.com. Attentive ranks #2 for enterprise promotional calendars. Sequenzy is the lifecycle email layer — welcome, education, winback, replenishment planning beside dedicated text senders.</p>
